<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll" itunes:timing="Line" xml:lang="ja"><head><metadata><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1"/><ttm:agent type="other" xml:id="v2"/><amll:meta key="ncmMusicId" value="2156579473"/><amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1744083898"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="Luna say maybe"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="初星学園 / 美波 / 月村手毬"/><amll:meta key="album" value="Luna say maybe"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithub" value="149807805"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithubLogin" value="Ma-hiru"/></metadata></head><body dur="04:25.267"><div begin="00:03.841" end="04:14.814"><p begin="00:03.841" end="00:04.408" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L1">あのね。<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你知道吗</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a no ne</span></p><p begin="00:32.130" end="00:33.829" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L2">I say “私、⼤丈夫？"<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我说 “我 没问题吗?”</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">I say “ wa ta shi da i jo u bu ?”</span></p><p begin="00:33.994" end="00:35.378" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L3">Maybe, うまくやれるはず<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">或许 我可以顺利地做到</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">Maybe u ma ku ya re ru ha zu</span></p><p begin="00:35.378" end="00:39.045" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L4">ずっと⾛った息継ぎもしないまま<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">连喘息的闲暇都没有一直都在奔跑</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">zu 't to ha shi 't ta i ki tsu gi mo shi na i ma ma</span></p><p begin="00:39.046" end="00:40.728" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L5">あっそう、終わりが来るなら<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">啊 是吗 如果结局到来的话</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a 's so u o wa ri ga ku ru na ra</span></p><p begin="00:40.822" end="00:42.545" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L6">別に寂しくなんかはない<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">其实我也不会觉得寂寞</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">be tsu ni sa bi shi ku na n ka ha na i</span></p><p begin="00:42.829" end="00:45.920" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L7">真実は⼼の奥の⽅<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">真相就藏在我心底</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">shi n ji tsu ha ko ko ro no o ku no ho u</span></p><p begin="00:45.920" end="00:48.654" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L8">⾃分のことすら愛せないまま<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">一直以来我甚至无法去爱自己</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ji bu n no ko to su ra a i se na i ma ma</span></p><p begin="00:48.654" end="00:53.337" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L9">君のこと守れるのかな<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">这样能否守护好你呢</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ki mi no ko to ma mo re ru no ka na</span></p><p begin="00:53.603" end="00:54.488" ttm:agent="v2" itunes:key="L10">“信じて"<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">“相信我”</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">“ shi n ji te ”</span></p><p begin="00:54.488" end="00:57.971" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L11">どうか、正真正銘のこの思いを<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">拜托了 将我这份真心实意的感情</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">do u ka sho u shi n sho u me i no ko no o mo i wo</span></p><p begin="00:57.971" end="01:01.354" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L12">聴いて 私、全⾝全霊で歌うから<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">倾听吧 我会竭尽全力将它歌唱出来</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ki i te wa ta shi ze n shi n ze n re i de u ta u ka ra</span></p><p begin="01:01.438" end="01:04.786" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L13">⼤丈夫、世界はこんなに綺麗だと、<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">没关系 这个世界是如此的美丽</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">da i jo u bu se ka i ha ko n na ni ki re i da to</span></p><p begin="01:04.786" end="01:07.336" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L14">分かってる、分かってる、解ってる…わかってるよ！<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我知道的 我都知道</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">wa ka 't te ru wa ka 't te ru</span></p><p begin="01:07.336" end="01:08.302" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L15">ごめんね。じれったい<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我很清楚 我明白啊</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">go me n ne ji re 't ta i</span></p><p begin="01:08.369" end="01:11.637" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L16">⾜りない、こんなんじゃ誰も愛せないの<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">抱歉 稍微有些焦急</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ta ri na i</span></p><p begin="01:11.721" end="01:15.152" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L17">⽌めない、⽌まることは知らないの<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">不会停歇 我并不知道该如何停下来</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">to me na i to ma ru ko to ha shi ra na i no</span></p><p begin="01:15.256" end="01:20.873" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L18">⾔葉⾜らず、失くしてしまう物ばかりだ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">词不达意</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ko to ba ta ra zu</span></p><p begin="01:20.873" end="01:24.469" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L19">Luna say maybe…<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">Luna say maybe......</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">Luna say maybe</span></p><p begin="01:24.824" end="01:27.908" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L20">降るのは、<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">眼前是迷雾重重的雨天</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">fu ru no ha me i be rainy</span></p><p begin="01:28.125" end="01:28.999" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L21">迷be,rainy<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">Maybe rainy(也许是迷失的雨吧）</span></p><p begin="01:36.121" end="01:37.746" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L22">愛せ、どんな⾃分でも<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">不论怎样的自己都要去爱</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a i se do n na ji bu n de mo</span></p><p begin="01:37.865" end="01:39.447" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L23">Navy⾊に染まるまで<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">直至染上那抹深蓝色为止</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">Navy i ro ni so ma ru ma de</span></p><p begin="01:39.649" end="01:42.927" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L24">時間はかかるかもしれないけど<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">虽然这需要一定的时间才可以做到</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ji ka n ha ka ka ru ka mo shi re na i ke do</span></p><p begin="01:42.943" end="01:44.625" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L25">I know, 輝くしかないこと<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">但我知道 只能绽放自我光彩</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">I know ka ga ya ku shi ka na i ko to</span></p><p begin="01:44.727" end="01:46.461" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L26">ハイライト、塗り続けるしかない<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">只能让人生充斥着各种高光时刻</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ha i ra i to nu ri tsu du ke ru shi ka na i</span></p><p begin="01:46.760" end="01:49.793" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L27">真実はちゃんと、⾔わなくちゃね<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">必须要将真相好好地说出口才行</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">shi n ji tsu ha cha n to i wa na ku cha ne</span></p><p begin="01:49.793" end="01:55.443" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L28">⽬に⾒えるものが<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">让目之所及全都继续下去</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">me ni mi e ru mo no ga tsu du ku to</span></p><p begin="01:55.543" end="01:59.443" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L29">続くと、ずっと<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我一直 没错 一直都如此作想</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">zu 't to so u zu 't to o mo i ta i</span></p><p begin="01:59.459" end="02:02.377" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L30">そう、ずっと<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">没错 一直都会</span></p><p begin="02:02.976" end="02:03.542" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L31">思いたい<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我总是一副对你将信将疑的模样</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ki mi ni ha n shi n ha n gi na so bu ri shi te</span></p><p begin="02:03.977" end="02:07.391" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L32">君に、半信半疑な素振りして<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">曾经对你 装出半信半疑的样子</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ki mi ni ha n shi n ha n gi na so bu ri shi te</span></p><p begin="02:07.461" end="02:10.860" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L33">⼼、空回り、遠回り<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">让真心沦为徒劳兜兜转转 实在是差劲</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ko ko ro ka ra ma wa ri to o ma wa ri sa i te i da</span></p><p begin="02:10.944" end="02:14.277" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L34">最低だ、もう⼀回やり直せるのなら<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">如果还有机会让一切重来的话</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">mo u i 'k ka i ya ri na o se ru no na ra</span></p><p begin="02:14.277" end="02:16.826" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L35">素直になりたい、なりたい、なりたいと<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我希望自己变得坦率 变得坦率 变得坦率起来</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">su na o ni na ri ta i na ri ta i na ri ta i to</span></p><p begin="02:16.826" end="02:17.711" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L36">願ったジレンマ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">心中所愿让我陷入了困境 如此一来</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ne ga 't ta ji re n ma ko no ma ma</span></p><p begin="02:17.711" end="02:21.294" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L37">このまま、1⼈じゃ何もできない<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">仅凭我一己之力根本成不了任何事</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">hi to ri ja na ni mo de ki na i</span></p><p begin="02:21.294" end="02:24.476" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L38">全部、決めるのは、⾃分次第<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">如何决定一切全都要看我自己</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ze n bu ki me ru no ha ji bu n shi da i</span></p><p begin="02:24.476" end="02:29.938" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L39">初めて背中をみた時に、覚悟を決めた。<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">当我第一次看到你的背影时</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ha ji me te se na ka wo mi ta to ki ni</span></p><p begin="02:29.938" end="02:31.321" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L40">どこまで<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">究竟可以前往何处呢 能否传达心意</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">do ko ma de i ke ru no ka to do ku no ka</span></p><p begin="02:31.321" end="02:34.748" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L41">いけるのか<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">都能去往吗</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">do ko ma de i ke ru no ka to do ku no ka</span></p><p begin="02:34.748" end="02:38.181" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L42">届くのか<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">都能抵达吗</span></p><p begin="02:38.181" end="02:41.681" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L43">わからないよ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">这些我都不知道</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">wa ka ra na i yo</span></p><p begin="02:41.715" end="02:43.432" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L44">臆病が<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">那份胆怯就驻足在我的心里</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">o ku byo u ga so ko ni ta 't te i ru</span></p><p begin="02:43.432" end="02:45.506" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L45">そこに⽴っている<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">停留原地</span></p><p begin="02:45.548" end="02:47.184" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L46">3秒前バックステージ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">在后台即将登场的3秒前</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">sa n byo u ma e ba 'k ku su te e ji</span></p><p begin="02:47.184" end="02:48.935" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L47">震える背中を君に預けて<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我将颤抖的背影交付于你</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">fu ru e ru se na ka wo ki mi ni a zu ke te</span></p><p begin="02:49.033" end="02:52.333" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L48">この運命的出会いは<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">这场命运般的邂逅</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ko no u n me i te ki de a i ha</span></p><p begin="02:52.335" end="02:57.250" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L49">きっと、そう、きっと<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">毋庸置疑 没错 一定如一场偶然般</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ki 't to so u ki 't to gu u ze n mi ta i na</span></p><p begin="02:57.250" end="02:59.002" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L50">偶然みたいな<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">就像这般偶然一样</span></p><p begin="02:59.235" end="03:02.933" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L51">多分、神様のいたずらです。<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">大概就是神明的恶作剧</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ta bu n ka mi sa ma no i ta zu ra de su</span></p><p begin="03:02.605" end="03:06.089" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L52">どうか、正⼼正銘のこの思いが<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">拜托了 直至将我真心实意的感情</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">do u ka sho u shi n sho u me i no ko no o mo i ga</span></p><p begin="03:06.174" end="03:09.506" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L53">君の⼼(ところ)にちゃんと届くまで<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">好好地传达至你的心里之前</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ki mi no to ko ro ni cha n to to do ku ma de</span></p><p begin="03:09.622" end="03:12.989" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L54">ここで、私、全⼼全霊で歌うから<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我都会驻足于此竭尽全力歌唱下去</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ko ko de wa ta shi ze n shi n ze n re i de u ta u ka ra</span></p><p begin="03:13.073" end="03:14.372" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L55">待ってる、待っている<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">等一下 等一等我</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ma 't te ru ma 't te i ru</span></p><p begin="03:14.372" end="03:15.476" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L56">だから、この場所を<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">所以我才想好好地</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">da ka ra ko no ba sho wo</span></p><p begin="03:15.476" end="03:16.556" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L57">⼤切にしたいの！<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">珍惜这个地方</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ta i se tsu ni shi ta i no</span></p><p begin="03:16.556" end="03:19.755" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L58">これが、正真正銘の私だ！<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">这就是真真正正的我</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ko re ga sho u shi n sho u me i no wa ta shi da</span></p><p begin="03:19.755" end="03:23.969" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L59">⼤丈夫、もう怖くはないわ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">没关系 已不再有所畏惧</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">da i jo u bu mo u ko wa ku ha na i wa</span></p><p begin="03:24.071" end="03:30.102" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L60">たまにつまづくことなら、あるけれど<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">虽然跌跌撞撞的经历</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ta ma ni tsu ma du ku ko to na ra</span></p><p begin="03:30.320" end="03:34.520" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L61">1番特等席で君の笑顔⾒たいんだ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我仍想在最佳的位置见证你的笑容</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">i chi ba n to ku to u se ki de ki mi no e ga o mi ta i n da</span></p><p begin="03:34.520" end="03:36.653" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L62">私だけの特権<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">这是只属于我的特权</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">wa ta shi da ke no to 'k ke n</span></p><p begin="03:37.243" end="03:39.023" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L63">⾒えない未来、⼿探り<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">伸手摸索无形的未来</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">mi e na i mi ra i te sa gu ri</span></p><p begin="03:39.023" end="03:46.908" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L64">今⽇もステージの上で証明して⾒せるから<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">今天我也会在舞台上</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">kyo u mo su te e ji no u e de</span></p><p begin="03:53.426" end="03:57.824" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L65">ここにしかないスクリーン<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">那个屏幕只存在于这个地方</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ko ko ni shi ka na i su ku ri i n</span></p><p begin="03:56.939" end="03:58.306" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L66">really! re@lly!<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">really！ re@lly！</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">Really re@ lly</span></p><p begin="04:04.892" end="04:08.860" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L67">君にまだ話せてないことばっかりあるんだ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我心里</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ki mi ni ma da</span></p><p begin="04:08.860" end="04:11.097" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L68">聴いて欲しいの<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">希望你可以倾听</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ki i te ho shi i no</span></p><p begin="04:11.097" end="04:14.814" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L69">あのね、<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你知道吗</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a no ne</span></p></div></body></tt>